        #mskm59JTMgg78S66CWibT2 ^"Protocol and Procedure" DEF {
            ^"Description" STRING "Once per round, when another character succeeds on a check to pursue a social objective (see page 254 of the core rulebook) a Kyūden Doji courtier may receive up to 4 strife to reduce the number of bonus successes on that check by that amount, to a minimum of 0 bonus successes (the check still succeeds)."
