            ^"Description" STRING "Activation: As an Attack and Movement action, using one readied polearm, Tsuneko may make a TN 3 Martial Arts [Unarmed] (Air) check with her unarmed kick profile (Range 1, Damage 2, Deadliness 1) targeting one character at range 1–2:\n\nEffects: If Tsuneko succeeds, the target suffers 2 physical damage plus additional damage equal to her bonus successes and the Disoriented condition.\n\nAir (op): Tsuneko moves 1 range band.\n\nAir (op) (op): One of Tsuneko's targets suffers the Prone condition.\n\nAir (op) (op)+: Tsuneko may choose an additional target for each (op) (op) spent in this way."
